@startuml
    title EU-2 Report-driven Retrieval of Imaging Data

    participant "Document Consumer (Imaging Manifest)" as Consumer
    participant "Document Access Provider (Imaging Manifest)" as DocProvider
    participant "Imaging Document Source" as Wado

    == Start from report ==
    Consumer -> DocProvider ++: Search and retrieve imaging report [ITI-67][ITI-68]
    DocProvider --> Consumer --: Imaging report
    Consumer -> Consumer: Determine image access is required

    == Resolve linked manifest ==
    note over Consumer: Determine StudyInstanceUID (or AccessionNumber) from report
    Consumer -> DocProvider ++: Search related manifest (using StudyInstanceUID or AccessionNumber) [ITI-67]
    DocProvider --> Consumer --: Matching manifest entries
    Consumer -> DocProvider ++: Retrieve selected manifest [ITI-68]
    DocProvider --> Consumer --: Manifest document

    == Retrieve DICOM content ==
    Consumer -> Consumer: Select target series and instances
    Consumer -> Wado ++: WADO-RS retrieval from manifest endpoint [RAD-160]/[RAD-107]
    Wado --> Consumer --: DICOM content
    Consumer -> Consumer: Render or process images with report context

@enduml
